  unitName: Storm Roundhouse Zeln
  unitId: 40145
  unitNumber: 842
  description: A fighter who trained at the Toltya Dojo. After suffering a furious
    punch from Nemia, Zeln finally realized how he felt about her as he tried to
    keep his balance. From that moment, he traveled to various regions in order to
    save people, growing as a reliable presence on the battlefield. Once he obtained
    information stating that the God Army planned to destroy the Vriksha Duchy, Zeln
    rushed towards Nemia's side to tell her once and for all about his feelings for
    her. He is said to have been clad in bolts of lightning.
  summonDesc: I put my heart into everything I do.<br>I didn't get it before,<br>but
    now I want to do whatever I can.
  fusionDesc: I need more power to help others.<br>No matter who gets in my way,<br>I'll
    always keep moving forward!
  evoDesc: I won't only protect her,<br>but I'll protect everyone else too.<br>That's
    the path I've chosen!
  element: 4
  rarity: 5
